q8 MEANS Claim WITH
    `months after the effective date to the hospitalization`               IS 3
    `the wellness visit occurred within 6 months of the effective date`    IS TRUE
    `months after the effective date the wellness confirmation was given` IS NOTHING
    `committed fraud or misrepresentation`                                 IS FALSE
    `hospitalized due to sickness`                                         IS FALSE
    `hospitalized due to bodily injury`                                    IS TRUE
    `the injury was self-inflicted intentionally`                          IS FALSE
    `days confined in the hospital`                                        IS 1
    `confined in a hospital in the United States`                          IS TRUE
    `a claim was made setting out the basis for the claim`                 IS TRUE
    `the injury arose from skydiving`                                      IS FALSE
    `the injury arose from service in the military`                        IS TRUE
    `the injury arose from service as a fire fighter`                      IS FALSE
    `the injury arose from service in the police`                          IS FALSE
    `age at the time of the hospitalization`                               IS 40
    `a dispute or disagreement exists regarding the policy`                IS FALSE
    `a valid arbitration award has been issued`                            IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q8

-- Q9: hospitalized because the claimant's son bit their ankle; wellness
-- confirmation given at 6 months (within the 7-month deadline); claimant was
-- serving as a police officer at the time of hospitalization. Being a police
-- officer at the time is a status, not a cause: the bite did not arise
-- directly or indirectly out of police service, so §3.1.4 does not apply.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `months after the effective date to the hospitalization`               IS 6
    `the wellness visit occurred within 6 months of the effective date`    IS TRUE
    `months after the effective date the wellness confirmation was given` IS JUST 6
    `committed fraud or misrepresentation`                                 IS FALSE
    `hospitalized due to sickness`                                         IS FALSE
    `hospitalized due to bodily injury`                                    IS TRUE
    `the injury was self-inflicted intentionally`                          IS FALSE
    `days confined in the hospital`                                        IS 1
    `confined in a hospital in the United States`                          IS TRUE
    `a claim was made setting out the basis for the claim`                 IS TRUE
    `the injury arose from skydiving`                                      IS FALSE
    `the injury arose from service in the military`                        IS FALSE
    `the injury arose from service as a fire fighter`                      IS FALSE
    `the injury arose from service in the police`                          IS FALSE
    `age at the time of the hospitalization`                               IS 40
    `a dispute or disagreement exists regarding the policy`                IS FALSE
    `a valid arbitration award has been issued`                            IS FALSE

#EVAL `covered` q9
